AltoRewardsDistributor::revokePendingRoot
├── when caller is not merkle root updater or owner
│   └── it should revert
├── when pending root is not set
│   └── it should revert
├── when merkle root to revoke is nonzero and does not match pending root
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is authorized and inputs are valid
    ├── when updater revokes root
    │   ├── it should emit RevokePendingMerkleRoot event
    │   └── it should delete pending root
    └── when owner revokes root
        ├── it should emit RevokePendingMerkleRoot event
        └── it should delete pending root
